    "title": "KC metro looks to the skies to see Northern Lights - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chandler Watkins ,\n2 hours ago LOUISBURG, Kan. (KCTV) - It was the talk of the town on Wednesday as many in the metro planned to head back outside to see the northern lights for the second night in a row. Down in Louisburg, the Astronomical Society of Kansas City invited everyone to the Powell Observatory for a chance to spot the colorful display across the night sky. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
